  <Text>k__BackingField: Traveling through a borough that has been mostly destroyed,
    you discover a dojo that not only appears to be untouched by the violence of
    the new occupation, but also seems to be open. Inside you spot a wizened woman
    standing before a small ensemble of martial artists calls out to you "I can teach
    you, but only if you prove yousrself as a worthy student."
  <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  Choices: 0
